WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.891
RUFUS: Tool calling means the
model can reach out

00:00:02.891 --> 00:00:05.782
RUFUS: and use external software —
run a search,

00:00:05.782 --> 00:00:08.673
RUFUS: check a database, trigger
another process. The Responses

00:00:08.673 --> 00:00:11.565
RUFUS: API is OpenAI's newer
framework that enables it.

00:00:11.565 --> 00:00:14.456
RUFUS: What's notable is that tool
calling is only

00:00:14.456 --> 00:00:17.347
RUFUS: available through
Responses, not through the older
Chat

00:00:17.347 --> 00:00:20.238
RUFUS: Completions pathway.

00:00:20.348 --> 00:00:22.864
ALEX: So if you want your agent to
actually

00:00:22.864 --> 00:00:25.381
ALEX: do things, rather than just
describe doing things,

00:00:25.381 --> 00:00:27.897
ALEX: you need the newer plumbing.

00:00:28.007 --> 00:00:29.716
RUFUS: Which means any team still
on the older

00:00:29.716 --> 00:00:31.426
RUFUS: integration has to migrate
before they get the

00:00:31.426 --> 00:00:33.135
RUFUS: full capability.

00:00:33.315 --> 00:00:35.797
JAMIE: That's not nothing for a
larger company.

00:00:35.977 --> 00:00:38.256
RUFUS: No. But it's a migration
with a clear

00:00:38.256 --> 00:00:40.535
RUFUS: destination, not a wall.
